WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.145
Welcome to our training on how to use Amazon Multi-Channel Fulfillment or MCF with Fulfillment by

00:00:07.145 --> 00:00:08.406
Amazon or FBA.

00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:15.130
Before we get started, you can watch Multi-Channel Fulfillment, how it works, on Seller University

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.072
or SU, to learn more about MCF.

00:00:18.072 --> 00:00:25.217
Or go to SU for the video Multi-Channel Fulfillment, Create Fulfillment Orders to get details on

00:00:25.217 --> 00:00:29.000
how to create single, bulk, hold, or API orders.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.944
Now back to the training.

00:00:30.944 --> 00:00:37.556
You can use MCF together with FBA, which allows you to consolidate your inventory into a single

00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:41.056
pool that can be used for all your Amazon.

00:00:41.056 --> 00:00:43.000
com and off Amazon orders.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.533
Combining these two fulfillment solutions can help you improve your inventory turnover and prevent

00:00:49.533 --> 00:00:50.000
stockouts.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.500
When a customer places an order through off Amazon channels, including your brand website, other

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:03.000
e-commerce marketplaces, and social media stores, you can create an MCF order with Amazon.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.300
And we'll pick that order from the inventory you've sent to a fulfillment center and pack it in

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.000
unbranded packaging.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.375
MCF orders can be delivered as quickly as two business days, seven days a week.

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:23.600
Like FBA, MCF provides real-time tracking on every order, so you and your customers can monitor

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:27.000
the progress of orders from click to delivery.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:33.800
You can also have any customer's return sent back to an Amazon fulfillment center where we'll determine

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:39.000
the product's status and add it to your inventory if it's still sellable.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:44.176
As an Amazon seller, you can use MCF through Seller Central.

00:01:44.176 --> 00:01:51.706
From the main menu, select Catalog, then click Add Products to upload them individually, or select

00:01:51.706 --> 00:01:55.000
Add Products via Upload for Bulk Upload.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Bulk uploads are best used by brands or those with a professional selling account.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.840
For a step-by-step guide on how to list products, see our video Match or Create product listings

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.000
one at a time on SU.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:16.000
If you haven't sent your inventory to a fulfillment center yet, you can use the Send to Amazon workflow.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Select Inventory from the main menu in Seller Central, then click Shipments.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.522
From the drop-down menu, click Send to Amazon.

00:02:24.522 --> 00:02:30.000
Watch Intro to Send to Amazon on SU for more information about the workflow.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.000
You can create and manage your orders from the MCF page in Seller Central.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Select Growth from the main menu, then click Multi-Channel Fulfillment MCF.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:48.333
On the left side of the screen, you can select Place Single Order or Place Bulk Order to create

00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:49.000
your order.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:54.000
You can also click View Orders or Track Orders to manage your MCF orders.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:01.238
And if you need support with an order, click Open a Support Ticket and enter your order ID, then

00:03:01.238 --> 00:03:02.000
click Continue.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.889
For MCF best practices, go to supplychain.

00:03:05.889 --> 00:03:06.444
amazon.

00:03:06.444 --> 00:03:07.000
com.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Choose Resources at the top of the page and select Knowledge Center.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.000
Set the filter type to Guide and search for Your Guide to Seller Central.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:25.000
This guide offers step-by-step instructions for order creation, inventory, returns, reports and

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.000
other topics.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:31.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon Store!
